From 31c06ced56a9e3f2555227bc5407db13f9eaf586 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sh1ftmaker <shiftmaker@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 21:33:52 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Decompile code_0802B4A8.c (105 functions)

The cutscene played after Dark Mind is defeated, structured like
code_08026044.c. sub_0802B4A8 is its only global function, started from
dark_mind.c; everything else is static (checked by scanning the ROM for
pointers and bl calls).

The file's rodata (gUnk_082EB4A0 to gUnk_082EB640) moves out of
data_17.s into the file, and gUnk_082EB6D0 moves into code_0802E16C.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
